<title>NEW ZEALAND: FCL Building 1st half profit falls.</title>
<headline>FCL Building 1st half profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>AUCKLAND 1996-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half yr to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				    53 vs 77</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)				 12.7 vs 21.0</p>
<p>    Div (cents)				  6.5 vs n/a</p>
<p>    Turnover (billion)			1.68 vs 1.90</p>
<p>    Pretax profit				 52 vs 74</p>
<p>    Tax						3 vs 2</p>
<p>Dividend carries 3.20 cps imputation credit.</p>
<p>Pay date April 2</p>
<p>Reg date March 14</p>
<p>    Ex div   March 17</p>
<p>Note - Fletcher Building is the contruction and building materials division of Fletcher Challenge. Market expectations were for a net profit of NZ$65-75 million. Result incluced NZ$29 million in depreciation, $3.0 million in depletions and $2.0 million in amortisation. -- Wellington newsroom 64 4 473-4746</p>
</text>
